## Project Details

**Project Title:**  
MediVoice AI — Real-Time AI Medical Voice Assistant

**Project Description:**  
Project Description:
MediVoice AI is a full-stack SaaS web application that lets users speak naturally about their symptoms and have a real-time voice conversation with a specialized AI doctor agent. The AI listens, responds with empathetic evidence-based guidance, and generates a structured consultation report at the end of each session covering symptoms, possible conditions, medications mentioned, and follow-up recommendations.
Problem it solves: Millions of people lack immediate access to basic medical guidance — especially after hours. Instead of unreliable Google searches, MediVoice AI offers a calm, conversational, AI-powered first step before seeing a real doctor.
Why it matters: It democratizes access to preliminary health guidance through voice — no forms, no typing, just talking.

**Tech Stack Used:**  
Next.js 15, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, Framer Motion, Clerk (Auth + Billing), Neon Postgres, Drizzle ORM, OpenAI GPT-4o, AssemblyAI Real-Time STT, OpenAI TTS, Vercel
